WEBVTT

11:31.384 --> 11:34.136
The Dothraki have never
crossed the narrow sea.

11:34.262 --> 11:36.472
They fear any water
their horses can't drink.

11:36.597 --> 11:38.140
But if they did?

11:39.684 --> 11:42.687
King Robert is fool enough
to meet them in open battle,

11:42.812 --> 11:45.398
but the men
advising him are different.

11:45.523 --> 11:49.860
- And you know these men?
- I fought beside them once,

11:49.986 --> 11:51.904
long ago.

11:52.029 --> 11:54.365
Now Ned Stark wants my head.

11:54.490 --> 11:56.742
He drove me from my land.

11:58.411 --> 12:00.454
You sold slaves.
